                      (/cmds/cobbler.asm):00028         * calculating it once and storing it in data.
                      (/cmds/cobbler.asm):00029         * Corrected sector count calculation to include partial clusters.
                      (/cmds/cobbler.asm):00030         *
                      (/cmds/cobbler.asm):00031         *        2014/12/09 Robert Gault
                      (/cmds/cobbler.asm):00032         * Report fragmented OS9Boot as normal but suggest using -e option if
                      (/cmds/cobbler.asm):00033         * used with modern Boot module that can handle fragmentation.
